// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`SubscriptionPaymentFailedEmail > matches the plain text body 1`] = `
"YOUR PAYMENT
DID NOT GO THROUGH

The renewal payment for your pencil case PRO subscription did not go through. Creem, our payment partner, retries automatically over the next days, so a temporary card hiccup resolves itself.

To sort it out right away, update your payment method in the customer portal:

Update payment method https://pencilcase.app/billing-portal

If the payment keeps failing, the subscription ends and the paid features switch off — resubscribing brings them right back."
`;

